css
 :root { --paper: #f6efe4; --ink: #2c2118; --muted: #6e6256; --line: rgba(44, 33, 24, .16); --kind: #b44a28; --gold: #c9a36a; --card: #fffaf3; }
 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
 html { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
 body { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1080px; padding: 0 28px; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; line-height: 1.5; }
 a { color: var(--kind); }
 a:hover, a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); }
 .site-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
 .mark { text-decoration: none; color: var(--kind); font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .site-header nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; }
 .site-header nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font: 700 10px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .13em; }
 .site-header nav a:hover, .site-header nav a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; }
 .hero { padding: 80px 0 72px; }
 .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 22px; color: var(--kind); text-transform: uppercase; font: 700 10px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .2em; }
 h1 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(56px, 11vw, 104px); font-weight: 400; line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.06em; color: var(--ink); }
 .lede { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); line-height: 1.25; }
 .kindness { max-width: 620px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px); }
 .band { padding: 56px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 h2 { margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .rules { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
 @media (min-width: 720px) { .rules { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
 .rule { margin: 0; padding: 18px 20px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; font-size: 17px; }
 .rule strong { display: block; margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
 .listings { display: grid; gap: 22px; }
 @media (min-width: 800px) { .listings { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
 .listing { overflow: hidden; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; }
 .listing video { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #1a1612; object-fit: contain; }
 .listing .meta { padding: 16px 18px 18px; }
 .listing h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
 .price { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--kind); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
 .who, .note { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--muted); }
 .phone { margin: 0; }
 .phone a { text-decoration: none; font: 700 13px/1.4 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .02em; }
 .empty-listings { max-width: 620px; margin: 0; padding: 36px 28px; border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; background: var(--card); }
 .how p { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.55; }
 .how p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
 .filename { display: block; margin: 10px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font: 15px/1.45 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--ink); }
 .how pre { max-width: 640px; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 14px 16px; overflow-x: auto; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font: 13px/1.5 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; }
 .site-footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 26px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font: 12px/1.5 Arial, sans-serif; }
 .site-footer p { margin: 0; }
 .site-footer a { color: var(--muted); }
 a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 4px; }
 @media (max-width: 560px) { body { padding: 0 18px; } .hero { padding: 48px 0 44px; } .band { padding: 40px 0; } }

html
 <header class="site-header">
  <a class="mark" href="index.html">kbay</a>
  <nav>
   <a href="#rules">The rules</a>
   <a href="#listings">Listings</a>
   <a href="#how">List something</a>
  </nav>
 </header>
 <main>
  <section class="hero">
   <p class="eyebrow">Neighbor to neighbor</p>
   <h1>kbay</h1>
   <p class="lede">Sell your stuff for cash.</p>
   <p class="kindness">The K stands for Kindness.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="band" id="rules">
   <h2>The rules</h2>
   <div class="rules">
    <p class="rule"><strong>Cash only</strong> Cash is the only payment method. No apps, no cards, no trades.</p>
    <p class="rule"><strong>In-person pickup only</strong> Meet your neighbors and pick things up in person. No shipping.</p>
    <p class="rule"><strong>N2N</strong> Neighbor to neighbor only. This is for friends and neighbors, not a store.</p>
    <p class="rule"><strong>No anonymous selling</strong> Every listing shows the seller’s first name and phone number.</p>
   </div>
  </section>

listings

html
  <section class="band how" id="how">
   <h2>List something</h2>
   <p>Have something a neighbor might need? Film a short video, add the file to the <code>listings/</code> folder, and send a <a href="https://github.com/breck7/kbay">pull request</a>. Listings are video only.</p>
   <p>Name the file like this, in this order, with a space-hyphen-space between each part:</p>
   <p><code class="filename">Title - FirstName - Location - Price - Phone.mp4</code></p>
   <p>Example:</p>
   <p><code class="filename">Kids Bike - Breck - Wahiawa - 40 - 808-555-0123.mp4</code></p>
   <p>The title can have spaces. Add <code>obo</code> after the price if you will take a lower cash offer, like <code>40obo</code>. The phone number can be written with or without dashes. Use your real first name and a number friends can call or text. There is no anonymous selling.</p>
   <p>Please shrink the video first so neighbors on slow connections can watch it. Aim for 480p, a CRF of about 28, and mono AAC at 64k, with faststart:</p>
   <pre>ffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf "scale=-2:480" -c:v libx264 -crf 28 -preset medium -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -ac 1 -b:a 64k -movflags +faststart "listings/Kids Bike - Breck - Wahiawa - 40 - 808-555-0123.mp4"</pre>
  </section>
 </main>
 <footer class="site-footer">
  <p>kbay · neighbor to neighbor · cash only · no shipping</p>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/breck7/kbay">Send a pull request</a> · <a href="https://x.com/breckyunits">@breckyunits</a></p>
 </footer>
